('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Network visibility and defense','Read the essential TCP/IP layers','Relate addresses, ports, protocols, and controls to application traffic.',17,1,TRUE,'https://www.cloudflare.com/learning/network-layer/what-is-the-tcp-ip-model/','ARTICLE'),('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Network visibility and defense','Inspect a packet capture with Wireshark','Identify DNS, TLS, and suspicious connection patterns in a supplied capture.',19,2,FALSE,'https://www.wireshark.org/docs/','DOCUMENT'),('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Network visibility and defense','Apply firewall and segmentation principles','Reduce unnecessary paths between public services, application tiers, and data.',16,3,FALSE,'https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/41/r1/final','ARTICLE'),('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Network visibility and defense','Document a secure network baseline','Record intended flows and a reviewable process for rule changes.',18,4,FALSE,'https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/secure-cloud-business-applications-scba','DOCUMENT'),
