('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Detection and incident response','Build a useful event timeline','Normalize timestamps and correlate application, identity, and network events.',18,1,TRUE,'https://attack.mitre.org/','ARTICLE'),('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Detection and incident response','Triage an alert without overclaiming','Capture observable facts and distinguish indicators from conclusions.',17,2,FALSE,'https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/federal-government-cybersecurity-incident-and-vulnerability-response-playbooks','DOCUMENT'),('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Detection and incident response','Contain and recover from an incident','Preserve evidence and restore service from a known-good state.',21,3,FALSE,'https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/61/r2/final','ARTICLE'),('Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Defense, Detection, and Response','Detection and incident response','Write an incident communication brief','Summarize scope, impact, actions, and unresolved questions.',16,4,FALSE,'https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/cybersecurity-incident-vulnerability-response-playbooks','DOCUMENT'),
